##     The fake records are copies of the 4 record files with c00100's and n10000's CNF hash replaced by the hash of the stub exe's 23-byte CNF.
##     OUTDIRs are on the scratchpad tmpfs (28 GiB free), so the stub runs pass RS_RELAX_LIMITS=1 RS_MIN_FREE_GB=0; F15a/F15c keep the floor.
